{"unit_id":"sybolization__agent-jit#card-zh","repo":"sybolization/agent-jit","commit":"3aea35f6c7682c288d4e1eee7c4e601770aa664e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Agent JIT 是面向 DSH 的工具编排插件：它注册 DSL 工具，把可确定的多步工具流程编译成图程序，再由 runtime 执行。模型可以先查询宿主当前可用工具的契约，再把工具调用、数据映射、筛选和结果组合写成一个程序提交。插件默认提供描述工具和执行工具，并可将 DSH 中已注册的工具纳入 DSL 编排，也支持白名单和排除列表。适合希望减少重复工具调用往返、由运行时处理确定性数据流的 DSH 用户。运行需要 Node.js 20 或更高版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/integrations/dsh/plugin.ts:122-167","src/adapter/jitTools.ts:115-175","src/adapter/jitTools.ts:188-240"]}
{"unit_id":"sybolization__agent-jit#card-en","repo":"sybolization/agent-jit","commit":"3aea35f6c7682c288d4e1eee7c4e601770aa664e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Agent JIT compiles deterministic DSH tool workflows into programs for runtime execution. Agents can inspect tool contracts, then use DSL to call tools and map, filter, or combine results. It can expose DSH host tools to workflows and reduce repeated call rounds. Requires Node.js 20+.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/integrations/dsh/plugin.ts:122-167","src/adapter/jitTools.ts:115-175","src/adapter/jitTools.ts:188-240"]}
